1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:03,203
This is the Demo Report Generator.

2
00:00:03,053 --> 00:00:10,533
It builds interactive SAS Visual Analytics reports in minutes: step by step,
or designed for you by AI.

3
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:14,777
There are two ways to build a report.

4
00:00:14,627 --> 00:00:19,178
Build it yourself, choosing every page, filter and chart.

5
00:00:19,028 --> 00:00:24,256
Or let the AI Report Assistant design the whole report for you, in under a
minute.

6
00:00:24,106 --> 00:00:28,813
Either way, you get one package that imports straight into SAS Viya.

7
00:00:30,550 --> 00:00:32,890
Option one: a custom report.

8
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:36,301
We name it, add the logo, and choose a colour theme.

9
00:00:40,050 --> 00:00:43,952
Then we connect the SAS table, and load a sample of the data.

10
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:52,223
Next, we choose every filter, KPI card and chart, page by page.

11
00:00:52,073 --> 00:00:54,410
The app checks each one as we go.

12
00:01:01,050 --> 00:01:05,642
The live preview shows the report exactly as Visual Analytics will.

13
00:01:10,217 --> 00:01:11,358
Option two.

14
00:01:11,208 --> 00:01:16,280
With the data loaded, we ask the AI Report Assistant to design the
report.

15
00:01:17,183 --> 00:01:23,703
In seconds, it creates the measures it needs, designs four pages, and
explains its choices.

16
00:01:26,850 --> 00:01:36,377
Each page answers a business question: how many sick leaves, what
drives the fraud score, and which doctors, facilities and patients need
review.

17
00:01:41,850 --> 00:01:45,609
Both reports import into SAS Viya in one step.

18
00:01:48,850 --> 00:01:52,830
Here is the custom report, running on the full production data.

19
00:01:53,750 --> 00:01:57,574
And here is the AI-designed report, on the same live data.

20
00:01:57,424 --> 00:02:02,431
Every filter and chart is interactive, across all four pages.

21
00:02:16,883 --> 00:02:18,233
Why does this matter?

22
00:02:18,083 --> 00:02:20,981
Reports are ready in minutes, not days.

23
00:02:20,831 --> 00:02:25,369
Teams keep full control, or get an AI design in under a minute.

24
00:02:25,219 --> 00:02:29,054
Every report is on brand, and fully interactive.

25
00:02:28,904 --> 00:02:33,116
And the AI sees the structure of the data, never the data rows.

26
00:02:35,017 --> 00:02:35,911
Thank you.
